{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"杏林在線｜中醫談慢性發炎\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/APP-ONLINE-CHINESEINFLAM-261109.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】談到慢性發炎，中醫認為它不是單一疾病，而是身體整體失衡，集中清熱解毒未必有效，而是要從整體入手改善體質，以防慢性發炎導致更嚴重疾病。今集《杏林在線》請來中大中醫學院教學助理、註冊中醫師霍詩迪跟我們講解。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.786544+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T13:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T15:15:50.365216+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:14.047927+00:00","content_hash":"2afe023883a7c9f64a3a9ae3d789117d07aea431609e6073dac1790a63702f87","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.786544+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}